{
    "title": "Domino Rivals - Board game",
    "description": "Dive into the thrill of intense competition with Domino Rivals, a board game that will captivate classic dominoes lovers. Like other popular board games, dominoes have migrated to mobile devices. Challenge players from around the world and experience the excitement and atmosphere of competitive board games.\r\nIn Domino Rivals, every match is an opportunity to showcase your strategic thinking and outplay your opponent. With our Competitions, you can see where you stand among the world's strongest domino players. Develop your winning strategy, hone your skills, and progress from beginner to domino master.\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Engage in intense domino battles with real opponents from all corners of the world\r\n- Experience 3 popular game modes: Draw Game, Kozel, and All Fives\r\n- Share emotions while playing dominoes\r\n- Track your game stats in your player profile\r\n- Collect special sets of Album cards and earn exciting rewards\r\n- Enjoy classic gameplay and addictive graphics\r\n- The All Fives mode includes hints, making it easy for beginners to master the game\r\n- Customize your tiles to showcase your style\r\nParticipate in in daily challenges and invite your friends to join this domino master race. All fans of classic dominoes online are welcome! Install Domino Rivals for free and enjoy endless competitive fun anytime, anywhere!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Dive into the thrill of intense competition with Domino Rivals, a board game that will captivate classic dominoes lovers. Like other popular board games, dominoes have migrated to mobile devices. Challenge players from around the world and experience the excitement and atmosphere of competitive board games.<br>In Domino Rivals, every match is an opportunity to showcase your strategic thinking and outplay your opponent. With our Competitions, you can see where you stand among the world&#39;s strongest domino players. Develop your winning strategy, hone your skills, and progress from beginner to domino master.<br>Features:<br>- Engage in intense domino battles with real opponents from all corners of the world<br>- Experience 3 popular game modes: Draw Game, Kozel, and All Fives<br>- Share emotions while playing dominoes<br>- Track your game stats in your player profile<br>- Collect special sets of Album cards and earn exciting rewards<br>- Enjoy classic gameplay and addictive graphics<br>- The All Fives mode includes hints, making it easy for beginners to master the game<br>- Customize your tiles to showcase your style<br>Participate in in daily challenges and invite your friends to join this domino master race. All fans of classic dominoes online are welcome! Install Domino Rivals for free and enjoy endless competitive fun anytime, anywhere!",
